    "review": {
      "summary": "AUD-02: A09 split points by scoring rule only; B07 used non-touchdown points; true volume was called unavailable. Arbit already holds it: gamebook.OPPORTUNITY_COLUMNS (attempts, carries, targets, fg_att, pat_att), team_features opps_pg, feature_specs opp_dvp_<pos>_opps_pg. nflverse stats_player and stats_team carry every needed count with no nulls in 2016-2025, and the field catalog classifies them as history (generic fantasy points excluded). The frozen provenance allowlist has no stats source and provenance.py is frozen, so a versioned admission with the same rules is needed. Each season's FFA targets manifest pins the exact stats files used.",
